{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe443-0cde-7003-989c-cac07f6e0941", "item_id": "item-108", "rollout_ordinal": 772, "created_at_ms": 1786241167287, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 772, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-108", "text": "Voy a compilar con Python 3.10 y probar imports. Si algo falla, debería salir aquí antes de que lo pruebes con el micrófono.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe443-0cde-7003-989c-cac07f6e0941", "item_id": "item-109", "rollout_ordinal": 779, "created_at_ms": 1786241182837, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 779, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-109", "summary": ["**Assessing pyworld pitch extraction impact**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe443-0cde-7003-989c-cac07f6e0941", "item_id": "item-110", "rollout_ordinal": 781, "created_at_ms": 1786241189673, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 781, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-110", "text": "Listo. Ahora durante la grabación se dibuja también la voz del usuario en tiempo real.\n\nCambios principales:\n\n- La referencia azul se muestra desde el principio al seleccionar la canción.\n- Al cantar, aparece una línea roja `Usuario` que se actualiza aproximadamente cada `0.55 s`.\n- La línea vertical negra sigue avanzando con la canción.\n- Aumenté el zoom horizontal: la ventana visible ahora es de `18 s` en vez de `40 s`.\n- El eje vertical ahora se reajusta a las notas visibles de la ventana, para que no quede todo aplastado.\n\nArchivos tocados:\n\n- [app.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/app.py)\n- [audio/karaoke.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py)\n- [audio/pitch.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/pitch.py)\n- [audio/visualizacion.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/visualizacion.py)\n\nLo verifiqué con Python 3.10/imports. Para probar:\n\n```powershell\n.\\iniciar_app.bat\n```\n\nSi todavía se ve poco claro, el siguiente ajuste directo es bajar `self.ventana_grafico = 18` a `12` o `10` en `app.py`.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-111", "rollout_ordinal": 789, "created_at_ms": 1786242123020, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 789, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-111", "clientId": "af3af2a7-91fd-4cf8-a561-038d5b228277", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "probemos con menor intervalo, tal vez 0.1 segundos, tambien ve de que manera puedes hacer que cuando se mueva no se \"tranque\", pues las notas como que aparecen de golpe cuando se va moviendo el grafico, tambien me gustaría la opción de cuando se termine todo se tenga la opción de \"ver detalle\" y se muestre el zoom, con barras para desplazarse horizontal y verticalmente (estando en esta opción se vería la opción de \"ver desempeño completo\" y se mostraría la versión sin zoom)\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-112", "rollout_ordinal": 790, "created_at_ms": 1786242132021, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 790, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-112", "summary": ["**Planning pitch extraction and cursor update optimization**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-113", "rollout_ordinal": 792, "created_at_ms": 1786242137444, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 792, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-113", "text": "Voy a hacer tres cosas coordinadas: bajar el intervalo de pitch en vivo a 0.1 s, suavizar el refresco para que el cursor no dependa de “bloques” grandes, y agregar un modo de detalle con controles de desplazamiento horizontal/vertical más un botón para volver al desempeño completo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-114", "rollout_ordinal": 803, "created_at_ms": 1786242148850, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 803, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-114", "summary": ["**Planning smoother real-time visualization**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-115", "rollout_ordinal": 805, "created_at_ms": 1786242150365, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 805, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-115", "text": "Ya tengo el punto exacto: el “salto” viene de dos cosas, el análisis de pitch se hacía en bloques relativamente largos y además el eje vertical se recalculaba con cada actualización. Voy a bajar el análisis a 0.1 s y fijar mejor la ventana visible para que el movimiento sea más continuo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "call_p5bEmJPx0nWhIsolUW4dtMC8", "rollout_ordinal": 808, "created_at_ms": 1786242153763, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 808, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_p5bEmJPx0nWhIsolUW4dtMC8", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -21,2 +21,4 @@\n     pitch_callback=None,\n+    intervalo_pitch=0.1,\n+    segundos_chunk_pitch=0.7,\n ):\n@@ -57,4 +59,4 @@\n                 progreso_callback(transcurrido)\n-            if pitch_callback is not None and transcurrido - ultimo_analisis >= 0.55:\n-                inicio_chunk_t = max(0, transcurrido - 1.4)\n+            if pitch_callback is not None and transcurrido - ultimo_analisis >= intervalo_pitch:\n+                inicio_chunk_t = max(0, transcurrido - segundos_chunk_pitch)\n                 inicio_chunk = int(inicio_chunk_t * samplerate)\n@@ -75,3 +77,3 @@\n                 ultimo_analisis = transcurrido\n-            sd.sleep(100)\n+            sd.sleep(35)\n     finally:\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-116", "rollout_ordinal": 812, "created_at_ms": 1786242157842, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 812, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-116", "text": "Ahora agrego el modo “detalle” con barras. Lo haré reutilizando el resultado final ya calculado, para que no recalcule análisis cada vez que mueves las barras.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "call_NaApumBzJlZDKnuAg1uYxbVP", "rollout_ordinal": 815, "created_at_ms": 1786242164825, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 815, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_NaApumBzJlZDKnuAg1uYxbVP", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\visualizacion.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -116,2 +116,30 @@\n \n+def aplicar_vista_detalle(ax, x_inicio, ventana, y_centro, rango_notas):\n+    ax.set_xlim(x_inicio, x_inicio + ventana)\n+\n+    y_min = int(np.floor(y_centro - rango_notas / 2))\n+    y_max = int(np.ceil(y_centro + rango_notas / 2))\n+    ticks = np.arange(y_min, y_max + 1)\n+    ax.set_yticks(ticks)\n+    ax.set_yticklabels([midi_to_nota(tick) for tick in ticks])\n+    ax.set_ylim(y_min, y_max)\n+    ax.grid(axis=\"y\", color=\"#d8d8d8\", linewidth=0.8)\n+    ax.grid(axis=\"x\", color=\"#eeeeee\", linewidth=0.6)\n+\n+\n+def rango_midi_grafico(*series_frecuencias):\n+    valores = []\n+    for frecuencias in series_frecuencias:\n+        midi = hz_to_midi(frecuencias)\n+        midi = midi[~np.isnan(midi)]\n+        if len(midi):\n+            valores.append(midi)\n+\n+    if not valores:\n+        return 48, 72\n+\n+    todos = np.concatenate(valores)\n+    return float(np.floor(np.min(todos)) - 1), float(np.ceil(np.max(todos)) + 1)\n+\n+\n def configurar_grafico_diagnostico(figura, diagnostico):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-117", "rollout_ordinal": 819, "created_at_ms": 1786242169056, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 819, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-117", "text": "También pondré los controles de detalle ocultos hasta que exista un resultado. Después de comparar aparecerá `Ver detalle`; dentro de ese modo aparecerán las barras y el botón `Ver desempeño completo`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "call_RzEkYHXexPBVIztpzmi43TUi", "rollout_ordinal": 822, "created_at_ms": 1786242180809, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 822, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_RzEkYHXexPBVIztpzmi43TUi", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\app.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -2,2 +2,3 @@\n import threading\n+import time\n import tkinter as tk\n@@ -17,2 +18,3 @@\n from audio.visualizacion import (\n+    aplicar_vista_detalle,\n     actualizar_usuario_tiempo_real,\n@@ -22,2 +24,3 @@\n     configurar_grafico_notas,\n+    rango_midi_grafico,\n )\n@@ -42,3 +45,9 @@\n         self.f_usr_tiempo_real = []\n-        self.ventana_grafico = 18\n+        self.ventana_grafico = 12\n+        self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = None\n+        self.detalle_ventana_x = 12\n+        self.detalle_rango_y = 14\n+        self.detalle_y_min = 48\n+        self.detalle_y_max = 72\n+        self.ultimo_redibujado = 0\n \n@@ -117,2 +126,15 @@\n         self.btn_diagnostico.pack(fill=tk.X, pady=(8, 0))\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle = ttk.Button(\n+            acciones,\n+            text=\"Ver detalle\",\n+            command=self.ver_detalle,\n+            state=tk.DISABLED,\n+        )\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle.pack(fill=tk.X, pady=(8, 0))\n+        self.btn_ver_completo = ttk.Button(\n+            acciones,\n+            text=\"Ver desempeño completo\",\n+            command=self.ver_desempeno_completo,\n+            state=tk.DISABLED,\n+        )\n \n@@ -142,2 +164,26 @@\n \n+        self.detalle_frame = ttk.Frame(panel_grafico, padding=(0, 8, 0, 0))\n+        ttk.Label(self.detalle_frame, text=\"Horizontal\").pack(side=tk.LEFT)\n+        self.scroll_x = tk.Scale(\n+            self.detalle_frame,\n+            from_=0,\n+            to=1,\n+            orient=tk.HORIZONTAL,\n+            resolution=0.1,\n+            showvalue=False,\n+            command=self.actualizar_detalle_desde_barras,\n+        )\n+        self.scroll_x.pack(side=tk.LEFT, fill=tk.X, expand=True, padx=(8, 16))\n+        ttk.Label(self.detalle_frame, text=\"Vertical\").pack(side=tk.LEFT)\n+        self.scroll_y = tk.Scale(\n+            self.detalle_frame,\n+            from_=48,\n+            to=72,\n+            orient=tk.HORIZONTAL,\n+            resolution=1,\n+            showvalue=False,\n+            command=self.actualizar_detalle_desde_barras,\n+        )\n+        self.scroll_y.pack(side=tk.LEFT, fill=tk.X, expand=True, padx=(8, 0))\n+\n     def set_trabajando(self, trabajando, texto):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-118", "rollout_ordinal": 826, "created_at_ms": 1786242184159, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 826, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-118", "text": "Voy a terminar de enlazar los estados: al seleccionar canción se oculta el detalle, al terminar aparece el botón de detalle, y las barras controlan la vista del resultado final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "call_7L0m7u5OKE5ll0vFzmfQ2tLX", "rollout_ordinal": 829, "created_at_ms": 1786242206415, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 829, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_7L0m7u5OKE5ll0vFzmfQ2tLX", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\app.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -238,2 +238,4 @@\n         self.resultado.set(\"\")\n+        self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = None\n+        self.ocultar_controles_detalle()\n         self.mostrar_notas_esperadas()\n@@ -301,2 +303,4 @@\n             self.resultado.set(\"\")\n+            self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = None\n+            self.ocultar_controles_detalle()\n             self.limpiar_grafico()\n@@ -338,2 +342,4 @@\n         self.resultado.set(\"\")\n+        self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = None\n+        self.ocultar_controles_detalle()\n         self.mostrar_notas_esperadas()\n@@ -389,2 +395,4 @@\n         self.f_usr_tiempo_real = []\n+        self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = None\n+        self.ocultar_controles_detalle()\n         self.mostrar_notas_esperadas(cursor_t=0)\n@@ -407,2 +415,4 @@\n                 pitch_callback=self._programar_actualizacion_pitch_usuario,\n+                intervalo_pitch=0.1,\n+                segundos_chunk_pitch=0.7,\n             )\n@@ -425,3 +435,7 @@\n         self.resultado.set(texto)\n-        self.mostrar_grafico(resultado.get(\"grafico\"))\n+        self.ultimo_resultado_grafico = resultado.get(\"grafico\")\n+        self.mostrar_grafico(self.ultimo_resultado_grafico)\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle.config(\n+            state=tk.NORMAL if self.ultimo_resultado_grafico else tk.DISABLED\n+        )\n         self.set_grabando(False, \"Comparacion finalizada.\")\n@@ -441,2 +455,68 @@\n \n+    def ocultar_controles_detalle(self):\n+        self.detalle_frame.pack_forget()\n+        self.btn_ver_completo.pack_forget()\n+        self.btn_ver_completo.config(state=tk.DISABLED)\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle.config(state=tk.DISABLED)\n+\n+    def ver_detalle(self):\n+        if not self.ultimo_resultado_grafico:\n+            return\n+\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle.config(state=tk.DISABLED)\n+        if not self.btn_ver_completo.winfo_ismapped():\n+            self.btn_ver_completo.pack(fill=tk.X, pady=(8, 0))\n+        self.btn_ver_completo.config(state=tk.NORMAL)\n+\n+        if not self.detalle_frame.winfo_ismapped():\n+            self.detalle_frame.pack(fill=tk.X)\n+\n+        datos = self.ultimo_resultado_grafico\n+        duracion = max(datos[\"t_ref\"] + datos[\"t_usr\"]) if datos[\"t_ref\"] or datos[\"t_usr\"] else 1\n+        x_max = max(0, duracion - self.detalle_ventana_x)\n+        self.scroll_x.config(from_=0, to=max(x_max, 0.1), resolution=0.1)\n+\n+        self.detalle_y_min, self.detalle_y_max = rango_midi_grafico(\n+            datos[\"f_ref\"],\n+            datos[\"f_usr\"],\n+        )\n+        self.scroll_y.config(\n+            from_=self.detalle_y_min,\n+            to=self.detalle_y_max,\n+            resolution=1,\n+        )\n+        self.scroll_x.set(0)\n+        self.scroll_y.set((self.detalle_y_min + self.detalle_y_max) / 2)\n+        self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n+\n+    def ver_desempeno_completo(self):\n+        if not self.ultimo_resultado_grafico:\n+            return\n+\n+        self.detalle_frame.pack_forget()\n+        self.btn_ver_completo.pack_forget()\n+        self.btn_ver_completo.config(state=tk.DISABLED)\n+        self.btn_ver_detalle.config(state=tk.NORMAL)\n+        self.mostrar_grafico(self.ultimo_resultado_grafico)\n+\n+    def actualizar_detalle_desde_barras(self, _valor=None):\n+        if self.ultimo_resultado_grafico and self.detalle_frame.winfo_ismapped():\n+            self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n+\n+    def mostrar_grafico_detalle(self):\n+        datos = self.ultimo_resultado_grafico\n+        if not datos:\n+            return\n+\n+        self.mostrar_grafico(datos)\n+        aplicar_vista_detalle(\n+            self.eje_grafico,\n+            float(self.scroll_x.get()),\n+            self.detalle_ventana_x,\n+            float(self.scroll_y.get()),\n+            self.detalle_rango_y,\n+        )\n+        self.figura.tight_layout()\n+        self.canvas_grafico.draw_idle()\n+\n     def mostrar_grafico(self, datos):\n@@ -492,3 +572,3 @@\n         actualizar_ventana_cursor(self.eje_grafico, tiempo, ventana=self.ventana_grafico)\n-        self.canvas_grafico.draw_idle()\n+        self.redibujar_grafico_suave()\n \n@@ -510,3 +590,9 @@\n         )\n-        self.canvas_grafico.draw_idle()\n+        self.redibujar_grafico_suave()\n+\n+    def redibujar_grafico_suave(self):\n+        ahora = time.monotonic()\n+        if ahora - self.ultimo_redibujado >= 0.045:\n+            self.canvas_grafico.draw_idle()\n+            self.ultimo_redibujado = ahora\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-119", "rollout_ordinal": 832, "created_at_ms": 1786242213959, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 832, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-119", "summary": ["**Identifying UI control timing and button state issues**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-120", "rollout_ordinal": 834, "created_at_ms": 1786242218669, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 834, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-120", "text": "Ya quedó conectado. Ahora hago una pasada de compilación con Python 3.10; en esta parte hay bastantes piezas de UI, así que prefiero pillar errores de nombres antes de que abras la app.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-121", "rollout_ordinal": 842, "created_at_ms": 1786242225025, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 842, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-121", "text": "La compilación pasó. Hago una prueba pequeña creando y cerrando la ventana desde código para confirmar que los nuevos botones/barras quedan inicializados sin fallar.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe453-c443-7831-8741-9241b48bd674", "item_id": "item-122", "rollout_ordinal": 848, "created_at_ms": 1786242235875, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 848, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-122", "text": "Listo. Dejé implementado lo que pediste:\n\n- El pitch del usuario en vivo ahora se intenta actualizar cada `0.1 s`.\n- El loop de grabación refresca más seguido (`35 ms`) para que el cursor se mueva más fluido.\n- Reduje la ventana del gráfico en vivo a `12 s`, con más zoom horizontal.\n- El eje vertical se ajusta a una ventana más acotada de notas para que se distingan mejor.\n- Después de terminar la comparación aparece `Ver detalle`.\n- En `Ver detalle` aparecen barras para desplazarte:\n  - horizontalmente por el tiempo\n  - verticalmente por las notas\n- En ese modo aparece `Ver desempeño completo`, que vuelve al gráfico completo sin zoom.\n\nArchivos modificados:\n\n- [app.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/app.py)\n- [audio/karaoke.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py)\n- [audio/visualizacion.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/visualizacion.py)\n\nVerifiqué compilación e inicialización de la UI con Python 3.10. Pruébalo con:\n\n```powershell\n.\\iniciar_app.bat\n```\n\nNota: `0.1 s` puede exigir bastante CPU porque extraer pitch en tiempo real no es barato. Si se siente pesado, el punto dulce probablemente esté entre `0.15` y `0.25 s`.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-123", "rollout_ordinal": 857, "created_at_ms": 1786242546789, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 857, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-123", "clientId": "bb39c709-6062-4ecd-a6dc-ead04b4f0def", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Todo bien, pero no hay barra lateral ni horizontal para recorrer el detalle, además de que se sigue \"trancando\", esto ultimo solo ocurre cuando yo canto, si solo se muestra la referencia funciona bien\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-124", "rollout_ordinal": 858, "created_at_ms": 1786242559368, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 859, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-124", "summary": ["**Inspecting Tkinter widget packing order**", "**Planning scrollbar implementation for detail view**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-125", "rollout_ordinal": 861, "created_at_ms": 1786242561557, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 861, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-125", "text": "Tiene sentido: si solo se mueve la referencia va fluido, el cuello está en el cálculo de pitch mientras cantas. Voy a separar la grabación/reproducción del análisis en vivo usando una cola y un worker, así el audio no se queda esperando al extractor de pitch. También voy a cambiar los controles de detalle a barras reales horizontal y lateral alrededor del gráfico.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-126", "rollout_ordinal": 871, "created_at_ms": 1786242591933, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 873, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-126", "summary": ["**Designing asynchronous pitch extraction worker**", "**Implementing pitch worker with queue and optimizing redraw**", "**Refining axis updates and implementing detailed scrollbars**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-127", "rollout_ordinal": 875, "created_at_ms": 1786242593160, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 875, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-127", "text": "El siguiente cambio es el importante para el “trancado”: el hilo que reproduce/graba ya no va a calcular pitch directamente. Solo va a dejar trozos de audio en una cola pequeña, y otro hilo los analiza; si se atrasa, descarta trozos viejos antes que congelar la reproducción.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "call_PGhmJhLHABFCz073WQvHl09l", "rollout_ordinal": 878, "created_at_ms": 1786242608132, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 878, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_PGhmJhLHABFCz073WQvHl09l", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -2,2 +2,4 @@\n import os\n+import queue\n+import threading\n import time\n@@ -47,4 +49,17 @@\n     inicio = time.monotonic()\n-    ultimo_pitch_t = 0\n     ultimo_analisis = 0\n+    pitch_queue = None\n+    pitch_stop = None\n+    pitch_worker = None\n+\n+    if pitch_callback is not None:\n+        pitch_queue = queue.Queue(maxsize=2)\n+        pitch_stop = threading.Event()\n+        pitch_worker = threading.Thread(\n+            target=_worker_pitch_tiempo_real,\n+            args=(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, samplerate),\n+            daemon=True,\n+        )\n+        pitch_worker.start()\n+\n     try:\n@@ -64,14 +79,3 @@\n                 chunk = np.asarray(grabacion[inicio_chunk:fin_chunk]).reshape(-1)\n-                t_pitch, f_pitch = extraer_pitch_desde_audio(\n-                    chunk,\n-                    samplerate,\n-                    offset_t=inicio_chunk_t,\n-                )\n-                nuevos = t_pitch > ultimo_pitch_t\n-                if np.any(nuevos):\n-                    ultimo_pitch_t = float(np.max(t_pitch[nuevos]))\n-                    pitch_callback(\n-                        [float(t) for t in t_pitch[nuevos]],\n-                        [float(f) for f in f_pitch[nuevos]],\n-                    )\n+                _encolar_pitch_reciente(pitch_queue, inicio_chunk_t, chunk)\n                 ultimo_analisis = transcurrido\n@@ -80,2 +84,6 @@\n         sd.stop()\n+        if pitch_stop is not None:\n+            pitch_stop.set()\n+        if pitch_worker is not None:\n+            pitch_worker.join(timeout=0.4)\n \n@@ -89,2 +97,45 @@\n \n+def _encolar_pitch_reciente(pitch_queue, inicio_t, chunk):\n+    if pitch_queue is None:\n+        return\n+\n+    try:\n+        pitch_queue.put_nowait((inicio_t, chunk))\n+    except queue.Full:\n+        try:\n+            pitch_queue.get_nowait()\n+            pitch_queue.task_done()\n+        except queue.Empty:\n+            pass\n+        try:\n+            pitch_queue.put_nowait((inicio_t, chunk))\n+        except queue.Full:\n+            pass\n+\n+\n+def _worker_pitch_tiempo_real(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, samplerate):\n+    ultimo_pitch_t = 0\n+    while not pitch_stop.is_set() or not pitch_queue.empty():\n+        try:\n+            inicio_chunk_t, chunk = pitch_queue.get(timeout=0.1)\n+        except queue.Empty:\n+            continue\n+\n+        try:\n+            t_pitch, f_pitch = extraer_pitch_desde_audio(\n+                chunk,\n+                samplerate,\n+                offset_t=inicio_chunk_t,\n+            )\n+            nuevos = t_pitch > ultimo_pitch_t\n+            if np.any(nuevos):\n+                ultimo_pitch_t = float(np.max(t_pitch[nuevos]))\n+                pitch_callback(\n+                    [float(t) for t in t_pitch[nuevos]],\n+                    [float(f) for f in f_pitch[nuevos]],\n+                )\n+        finally:\n+            pitch_queue.task_done()\n+\n+\n def comparar_grabacion(cancion, ruta_grabacion):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-128", "rollout_ordinal": 882, "created_at_ms": 1786242610787, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 882, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-128", "text": "Ahora reemplazo los sliders por barras de desplazamiento reales pegadas al gráfico: una abajo para tiempo y una al costado para notas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "call_CHbiixmKoNmGfQLgZLnWiA9Z", "rollout_ordinal": 885, "created_at_ms": 1786242622378, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 885, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_CHbiixmKoNmGfQLgZLnWiA9Z", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\app.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -49,2 +49,5 @@\n         self.detalle_rango_y = 14\n+        self.detalle_x_inicio = 0\n+        self.detalle_x_max = 0\n+        self.detalle_y_inicio = 48\n         self.detalle_y_min = 48\n@@ -151,2 +154,4 @@\n         panel_grafico.pack(fill=tk.BOTH, expand=True)\n+        panel_grafico.columnconfigure(0, weight=1)\n+        panel_grafico.rowconfigure(0, weight=1)\n         self.figura = Figure(figsize=(8, 3.4), dpi=100)\n@@ -162,27 +167,17 @@\n         self.canvas_grafico = FigureCanvasTkAgg(self.figura, master=panel_grafico)\n-        self.canvas_grafico.get_tk_widget().pack(fill=tk.BOTH, expand=True)\n-\n-        self.detalle_frame = ttk.Frame(panel_grafico, padding=(0, 8, 0, 0))\n-        ttk.Label(self.detalle_frame, text=\"Horizontal\").pack(side=tk.LEFT)\n-        self.scroll_x = tk.Scale(\n-            self.detalle_frame,\n-            from_=0,\n-            to=1,\n-            orient=tk.HORIZONTAL,\n-            resolution=0.1,\n-            showvalue=False,\n-            command=self.actualizar_detalle_desde_barras,\n+        self.canvas_grafico.get_tk_widget().grid(row=0, column=0, sticky=\"nsew\")\n+        self.scroll_y = ttk.Scrollbar(\n+            panel_grafico,\n+            orient=tk.VERTICAL,\n+            command=self.desplazar_detalle_y,\n         )\n-        self.scroll_x.pack(side=tk.LEFT, fill=tk.X, expand=True, padx=(8, 16))\n-        ttk.Label(self.detalle_frame, text=\"Vertical\").pack(side=tk.LEFT)\n-        self.scroll_y = tk.Scale(\n-            self.detalle_frame,\n-            from_=48,\n-            to=72,\n+        self.scroll_x = ttk.Scrollbar(\n+            panel_grafico,\n             orient=tk.HORIZONTAL,\n-            resolution=1,\n-            showvalue=False,\n-            command=self.actualizar_detalle_desde_barras,\n+            command=self.desplazar_detalle_x,\n         )\n-        self.scroll_y.pack(side=tk.LEFT, fill=tk.X, expand=True, padx=(8, 0))\n+        self.scroll_y.grid(row=0, column=1, sticky=\"ns\")\n+        self.scroll_x.grid(row=1, column=0, sticky=\"ew\")\n+        self.scroll_y.grid_remove()\n+        self.scroll_x.grid_remove()\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-129", "rollout_ordinal": 889, "created_at_ms": 1786242625355, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 889, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-129", "text": "Sigo ajustando la lógica de esas barras para que se comporten como scrollbars: arrastrar, mover por unidad/página, y sincronizar el “thumb” con la ventana visible.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "call_7LfKcJQQ6RDNCwh8XAGd7553", "rollout_ordinal": 892, "created_at_ms": 1786242647873, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 892, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_7LfKcJQQ6RDNCwh8XAGd7553", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\app.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -451,3 +451,4 @@\n     def ocultar_controles_detalle(self):\n-        self.detalle_frame.pack_forget()\n+        self.scroll_x.grid_remove()\n+        self.scroll_y.grid_remove()\n         self.btn_ver_completo.pack_forget()\n@@ -465,4 +466,4 @@\n \n-        if not self.detalle_frame.winfo_ismapped():\n-            self.detalle_frame.pack(fill=tk.X)\n+        self.scroll_x.grid()\n+        self.scroll_y.grid()\n \n@@ -470,4 +471,4 @@\n         duracion = max(datos[\"t_ref\"] + datos[\"t_usr\"]) if datos[\"t_ref\"] or datos[\"t_usr\"] else 1\n-        x_max = max(0, duracion - self.detalle_ventana_x)\n-        self.scroll_x.config(from_=0, to=max(x_max, 0.1), resolution=0.1)\n+        self.detalle_x_max = max(0, duracion - self.detalle_ventana_x)\n+        self.detalle_x_inicio = 0\n \n@@ -477,9 +478,3 @@\n         )\n-        self.scroll_y.config(\n-            from_=self.detalle_y_min,\n-            to=self.detalle_y_max,\n-            resolution=1,\n-        )\n-        self.scroll_x.set(0)\n-        self.scroll_y.set((self.detalle_y_min + self.detalle_y_max) / 2)\n+        self.detalle_y_inicio = self.detalle_y_min\n         self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n@@ -490,3 +485,4 @@\n \n-        self.detalle_frame.pack_forget()\n+        self.scroll_x.grid_remove()\n+        self.scroll_y.grid_remove()\n         self.btn_ver_completo.pack_forget()\n@@ -496,6 +492,47 @@\n \n-    def actualizar_detalle_desde_barras(self, _valor=None):\n-        if self.ultimo_resultado_grafico and self.detalle_frame.winfo_ismapped():\n-            self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n+    def desplazar_detalle_x(self, *args):\n+        if not self.ultimo_resultado_grafico:\n+            return\n+\n+        self.detalle_x_inicio = self._mover_scroll(\n+            args,\n+            self.detalle_x_inicio,\n+            0,\n+            self.detalle_x_max,\n+            unidad=1,\n+            pagina=self.detalle_ventana_x * 0.85,\n+        )\n+        self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n \n+    def desplazar_detalle_y(self, *args):\n+        if not self.ultimo_resultado_grafico:\n+            return\n+\n+        y_max_inicio = max(self.detalle_y_min, self.detalle_y_max - self.detalle_rango_y)\n+        self.detalle_y_inicio = self._mover_scroll(\n+            args,\n+            self.detalle_y_inicio,\n+            self.detalle_y_min,\n+            y_max_inicio,\n+            unidad=1,\n+            pagina=max(1, self.detalle_rango_y * 0.8),\n+        )\n+        self.mostrar_grafico_detalle()\n+\n+    def _mover_scroll(self, args, valor_actual, minimo, maximo, unidad, pagina):\n+        if not args:\n+            return valor_actual\n+\n+        accion = args[0]\n+        nuevo = valor_actual\n+        if accion == \"moveto\":\n+            fraccion = float(args[1])\n+            nuevo = minimo + fraccion * max(maximo - minimo, 0)\n+        elif accion == \"scroll\":\n+            cantidad = int(args[1])\n+            tipo = args[2]\n+            nuevo += cantidad * (pagina if tipo == \"pages\" else unidad)\n+\n+        return min(max(nuevo, minimo), maximo)\n+\n     def mostrar_grafico_detalle(self):\n@@ -508,7 +545,8 @@\n             self.eje_grafico,\n-            float(self.scroll_x.get()),\n+            self.detalle_x_inicio,\n             self.detalle_ventana_x,\n-            float(self.scroll_y.get()),\n+            self.detalle_y_inicio + self.detalle_rango_y / 2,\n             self.detalle_rango_y,\n         )\n+        self.actualizar_scrollbars_detalle()\n         self.figura.tight_layout()\n@@ -516,2 +554,17 @@\n \n+    def actualizar_scrollbars_detalle(self):\n+        x_total = self.detalle_x_max + self.detalle_ventana_x\n+        if x_total <= 0:\n+            self.scroll_x.set(0, 1)\n+        else:\n+            self.scroll_x.set(\n+                self.detalle_x_inicio / x_total,\n+                min((self.detalle_x_inicio + self.detalle_ventana_x) / x_total, 1),\n+            )\n+\n+        y_total = max(self.detalle_y_max - self.detalle_y_min, self.detalle_rango_y)\n+        y_start = (self.detalle_y_inicio - self.detalle_y_min) / y_total\n+        y_end = min((self.detalle_y_inicio + self.detalle_rango_y - self.detalle_y_min) / y_total, 1)\n+        self.scroll_y.set(y_start, y_end)\n+\n     def mostrar_grafico(self, datos):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-130", "rollout_ordinal": 895, "created_at_ms": 1786242659212, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 896, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-130", "summary": ["**Planning scrollbar and legend adjustments**", "**Optimizing legend updates and axis redraw frequency**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-131", "rollout_ordinal": 898, "created_at_ms": 1786242660338, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 898, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-131", "text": "También voy a reducir trabajo gráfico durante el canto: la línea roja solo dibujará los puntos visibles de la ventana actual, y la leyenda no se recalculará en cada actualización. Eso debería quitar parte del tirón visual.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "call_li63NwaqWVAAKxXBdNNQfLT1", "rollout_ordinal": 901, "created_at_ms": 1786242666194, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 901, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_li63NwaqWVAAKxXBdNNQfLT1", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\visualizacion.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -94,5 +94,12 @@\n def actualizar_usuario_tiempo_real(ax, t_usr, f_usr, cursor_t, ventana=18):\n-    y_usr = hz_to_midi(f_usr)\n-    t_usr_plot, y_usr_plot = _insertar_cortes_por_silencio(t_usr, y_usr)\n+    inicio = max(0, cursor_t - ventana * 0.45)\n+    fin = inicio + ventana * 1.1\n+    t_usr = np.asarray(t_usr, dtype=float)\n+    f_usr = np.asarray(f_usr, dtype=float)\n+    mask_visible = (t_usr >= inicio) & (t_usr <= fin)\n+    t_visible = t_usr[mask_visible]\n+    y_usr = hz_to_midi(f_usr[mask_visible])\n+    t_usr_plot, y_usr_plot = _insertar_cortes_por_silencio(t_visible, y_usr)\n \n+    creada = False\n     for linea in ax.lines:\n@@ -103,2 +110,3 @@\n     else:\n+        creada = True\n         ax.plot(\n@@ -113,3 +121,4 @@\n     _ajustar_vista_tiempo_real(ax, cursor_t, ventana)\n-    ax.legend(loc=\"upper right\")\n+    if creada:\n+        ax.legend(loc=\"upper right\")\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
