{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-133", "rollout_ordinal": 906, "created_at_ms": 1786242678361, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 906, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-133", "text": "Voy a correr compilación e inicialización de UI. Si falla algo con las barras reales o con el worker de pitch, debería aparecer aquí.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-134", "rollout_ordinal": 916, "created_at_ms": 1786242682644, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 916, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-134", "text": "La verificación pasó. Voy a limpiar dos textos que seguían con caracteres raros por codificación para que la interfaz se vea prolija.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-135", "rollout_ordinal": 926, "created_at_ms": 1786242692768, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 926, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-135", "text": "No encontró esos caracteres en el archivo actual; lo que vimos antes venía de cómo PowerShell lo imprimió. Hago una última compilación corta después de los cambios.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "019fe45a-3beb-72d0-aac1-06e5b09df22a", "item_id": "item-136", "rollout_ordinal": 932, "created_at_ms": 1786242703902, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 932, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-136", "text": "Listo, ajusté ambas cosas.\n\nPara el “trancado”, cambié el cálculo de pitch en vivo para que no ocurra dentro del mismo loop que controla la grabación/reproducción. Ahora el audio solo encola trozos recientes y un worker separado calcula el pitch. Si el análisis se atrasa, descarta trozos viejos antes que frenar el movimiento.\n\nTambién cambié el detalle:\n\n- Ahora sí hay una barra horizontal real bajo el gráfico.\n- Ahora sí hay una barra vertical real al costado derecho.\n- `Ver detalle` muestra el zoom con barras.\n- `Ver desempeño completo` oculta las barras y vuelve al gráfico completo.\n\nAdemás optimicé el gráfico en vivo:\n\n- El pitch se intenta analizar cada `0.1 s`.\n- La línea roja solo dibuja los puntos visibles de la ventana actual.\n- La leyenda no se recalcula en cada actualización.\n- El loop de progreso corre más seguido para que el cursor se mueva más fluido.\n\nArchivos modificados:\n\n- [app.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/app.py)\n- [audio/karaoke.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py)\n- [audio/visualizacion.py](C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/visualizacion.py)\n\nVerifiqué compilación e inicialización de UI con Python 3.10. Pruébalo con:\n\n```powershell\n.\\iniciar_app.bat\n```\n\nNo pude probar el comportamiento real con micrófono desde aquí, pero el cambio ataca justamente el síntoma que describes: el tirón al cantar, no al mover solo la referencia.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-137", "rollout_ordinal": 943, "created_at_ms": 1787157133882, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 943, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-137", "clientId": "732a6b25-ceb4-4e0f-9ba4-e417fdebb1bf", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "podriamos cambiar el framework visual? siento que limita mucho tanto la funcionalidad como la estetica del proyecto, siento que se ve muy feo y tosco, no parece un programa actual, podrias crear archivos visuales como pruebas sin funcionalidades para probar cual se ve mejor?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-138", "rollout_ordinal": 944, "created_at_ms": 1787157147043, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 945, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-138", "summary": ["**Planning creation of frontend mockups**", "**Reviewing visualization skill and repo structure**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-139", "rollout_ordinal": 947, "created_at_ms": 1787157148476, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 947, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-139", "text": "Sí, totalmente. Tkinter nos sirvió para validar la lógica, pero para una experiencia moderna conviene separar motor de audio + interfaz y probar una UI web o Qt. Voy a usar la skill `visualize` para crear mockups visuales navegables, sin funcionalidad real, y dejar varias propuestas comparables.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-140", "rollout_ordinal": 952, "created_at_ms": 1787157180732, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 954, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-140", "summary": ["**Clarifying user request for visual files**", "**Planning static HTML mockup creation**", "**Designing multi-file static HTML mockups with CSS**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-141", "rollout_ordinal": 956, "created_at_ms": 1787157181858, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 956, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-141", "text": "Voy a dejar un set de mockups HTML/CSS dentro del proyecto, separados de la app actual. Serán solo visuales: sirven para comparar estilo y decidir si migramos hacia una interfaz web moderna, sin tocar todavía la lógica de audio.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-142", "rollout_ordinal": 961, "created_at_ms": 1787157186364, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 961, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-142", "text": "Voy a crear tres direcciones visuales: una tipo estudio profesional, una enfocada en modo karaoke en vivo, y otra mas analitica para tesis/medicion.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "call_2iEkSYayXHZ6WeNvrTwX2NTb", "rollout_ordinal": 964, "created_at_ms": 1787157227454, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 964, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_2iEkSYayXHZ6WeNvrTwX2NTb", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\mockups\\mockups.css", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": ":root {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  --ink: #1c2029;\n  --muted: #6b7280;\n  --soft: #f4f6f8;\n  --panel: #ffffff;\n  --line: #d8dee8;\n  --blue: #2364d2;\n  --red: #d64d45;\n  --green: #14866d;\n  --amber: #b7791f;\n  --violet: #6957d9;\n  --shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(20, 27, 38, 0.12);\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  background: #e9edf3;\n  font-family: Inter, \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.page {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.shell {\n  min-height: calc(100vh - 48px);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--panel);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(34, 42, 56, 0.12);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n\n.topbar,\n.toolbar,\n.song-row,\n.metric-row,\n.control-row,\n.detail-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.topbar {\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  min-height: 64px;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.mark {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  color: white;\n  background: #151923;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.muted {\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.layout {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr);\n  min-height: calc(100vh - 114px);\n}\n\n.sidebar {\n  padding: 18px;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);\n}\n\n.main {\n  min-width: 0;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.song-list {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.song-row {\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.song-row.active {\n  background: #eef4ff;\n  border-color: #c8d9fb;\n}\n\n.song-main {\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.song-title {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  font-weight: 650;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.song-artist {\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.badge {\n  padding: 3px 7px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 650;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.badge.ready {\n  color: #0d6b56;\n  background: #dff7ef;\n}\n\n.badge.live {\n  color: #9f2f29;\n  background: #fee7e4;\n}\n\n.toolbar {\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.button {\n  min-height: 36px;\n  padding: 0 12px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius: 7px;\n  font-weight: 650;\n}\n\n.button.primary {\n  color: #ffffff;\n  background: #151923;\n  border-color: #151923;\n}\n\n.button.danger {\n  color: #9f2f29;\n  border-color: #f2b8b2;\n}\n\n.button.ghost {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.graph {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  min-height: 330px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 25px, rgba(39, 47, 64, 0.11) 26px),\n    repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0 74px, rgba(39, 47, 64, 0.08) 75px),\n    #ffffff;\n}\n\n.pitch-ref,\n.pitch-user {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n.pitch-ref path,\n.pitch-user path {\n  fill: none;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n\n.pitch-ref path {\n  stroke: var(--blue);\n  stroke-width: 5;\n}\n\n.pitch-user path {\n  stroke: var(--red);\n  stroke-width: 5;\n}\n\n.note-axis {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 14px;\n  bottom: 14px;\n  left: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 650;\n}\n\n.cursor {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 44%;\n  width: 2px;\n  background: #161a22;\n}\n\n.cursor::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 10px;\n  left: -5px;\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 12px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #161a22;\n}\n\n.metric-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-top: 14px;\n}\n\n.metric {\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.metric-label {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.metric-value {\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 750;\n}\n\n.timeline {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0, 1fr) 52px;\n  gap: 10px;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.track {\n  height: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #e7ebf0;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.track span {\n  display: block;\n  width: 42%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: var(--green);\n}\n\n.scrollbar-x,\n.scrollbar-y {\n  position: absolute;\n  background: rgba(20, 27, 38, 0.1);\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.scrollbar-x {\n  right: 18px;\n  bottom: 12px;\n  left: 58px;\n  height: 8px;\n}\n\n.scrollbar-y {\n  top: 18px;\n  right: 12px;\n  bottom: 34px;\n  width: 8px;\n}\n\n.scrollbar-x span,\n.scrollbar-y span {\n  display: block;\n  background: rgba(20, 27, 38, 0.45);\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.scrollbar-x span {\n  width: 28%;\n  height: 100%;\n  transform: translateX(110%);\n}\n\n.scrollbar-y span {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 32%;\n  transform: translateY(92%);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .sidebar {\n    border-right: 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n\n  .metric-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  }\n}\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-143", "rollout_ordinal": 967, "created_at_ms": 1787157230498, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 967, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-143", "text": "Ya está el sistema visual base. Ahora creo el primer mockup: estilo estudio moderno, más sobrio y cercano a una app de escritorio profesional.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "call_WR9etMNIssgdIcMXr0WjPqiW", "rollout_ordinal": 970, "created_at_ms": 1787157253005, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 970, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_WR9etMNIssgdIcMXr0WjPqiW", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\mockups\\studio.html", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Karaoke Studio Mockup</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"mockups.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"shell\">\n      <header class=\"topbar\">\n        <div class=\"brand\">\n          <div class=\"mark\">K</div>\n          <div>\n            <div>Karaoke Studio</div>\n            <div class=\"muted\">Afinacion guiada en tiempo real</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"toolbar\">\n          <button class=\"button ghost\">Diagnostico</button>\n          <button class=\"button\">Reprocesar</button>\n          <button class=\"button primary\">Cantar</button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"layout\">\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">Catalogo</h2>\n          <div class=\"song-list\">\n            <div class=\"song-row active\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Contigo en la distancia</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">Luis Miguel</div>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"badge ready\">Lista</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">La incondicional</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">Luis Miguel</div>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"badge ready\">Lista</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Nada fue un error</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">Coti</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Agregar nueva cancion</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">WAV, MP3, FLAC</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"main\">\n          <div class=\"detail-row\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n            <div>\n              <h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 24px;\">Contigo en la distancia</h1>\n              <div class=\"muted\">Referencia vocal preparada - Instrumental disponible</div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"badge live\">Grabando</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"graph\">\n            <div class=\"note-axis\">\n              <span>A4</span><span>G4</span><span>F4</span><span>E4</span><span>D4</span><span>C4</span><span>B3</span>\n            </div>\n            <svg class=\"pitch-ref\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 330\" aria-label=\"Pitch esperado\">\n              <path d=\"M60 230 L95 230 L118 185 L158 185 L188 205 L225 205 L260 145 L304 145 L342 162 L385 162 L430 120 L470 120 L518 150 L560 150 L604 98 L650 98 L696 128 L744 128 L790 176 L836 176\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"pitch-user\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 330\" aria-label=\"Pitch usuario\">\n              <path d=\"M60 242 L100 238 L122 194 L161 188 L190 218 L228 210 L262 151 L306 153 L348 175 L388 168 L433 132 L472 130\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"cursor\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"timeline\">\n            <span>0:38</span>\n            <div class=\"track\"><span></span></div>\n            <span>3:12</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"metric-grid\">\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"metric-label\">Error promedio</div>\n              <div class=\"metric-value\">42c</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"metric-label\">Dentro de +/-50c</div>\n              <div class=\"metric-value\">71%</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"metric-label\">Tendencia</div>\n              <div class=\"metric-value\">Estable</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"metric-label\">Puntos validos</div>\n              <div class=\"metric-value\">842</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-144", "rollout_ordinal": 973, "created_at_ms": 1787157255279, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 973, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-144", "text": "Ahora va una propuesta más escénica, pensada para cantar: menos tabla, más foco en el recorrido de notas y controles grandes.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "call_fUCfSZjUAcpcmZQUyk0vVSez", "rollout_ordinal": 976, "created_at_ms": 1787157284845, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 976, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_fUCfSZjUAcpcmZQUyk0vVSez", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\mockups\\live.html", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Karaoke Live Mockup</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"mockups.css\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      color: #eef2f6;\n      background: #141414;\n    }\n\n    .shell {\n      background: #1e1f22;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);\n    }\n\n    .topbar,\n    .sidebar {\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    }\n\n    .sidebar {\n      background: #17191d;\n    }\n\n    .mark {\n      color: #141414;\n      background: #f4c15d;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      color: #eef2f6;\n      background: #292c31;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n    }\n\n    .button.primary {\n      color: #141414;\n      background: #f4c15d;\n      border-color: #f4c15d;\n    }\n\n    .song-row.active {\n      background: rgba(244, 193, 93, 0.13);\n      border-color: rgba(244, 193, 93, 0.38);\n    }\n\n    .graph {\n      min-height: 420px;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 31px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13) 32px),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0 92px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 93px),\n        #111317;\n    }\n\n    .pitch-ref path {\n      stroke: #61a5ff;\n    }\n\n    .pitch-user path {\n      stroke: #ff756b;\n    }\n\n    .cursor,\n    .cursor::before {\n      background: #f4c15d;\n    }\n\n    .metric {\n      background: #25282e;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    }\n\n    .track {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n    }\n\n    .track span {\n      background: #f4c15d;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"shell\">\n      <header class=\"topbar\">\n        <div class=\"brand\">\n          <div class=\"mark\">K</div>\n          <div>\n            <div>Karaoke Live</div>\n            <div class=\"muted\">Modo interpretacion</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"toolbar\">\n          <button class=\"button danger\">Detener</button>\n          <button class=\"button primary\">Grabando 0:38</button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"layout\">\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">Cancion actual</h2>\n          <div class=\"song-row active\">\n            <div class=\"song-main\">\n              <div class=\"song-title\">Contigo en la distancia</div>\n              <div class=\"song-artist\">Luis Miguel - 3:12</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"height: 18px;\"></div>\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">Siguiente</h2>\n          <div class=\"song-list\">\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">La incondicional</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">Lista</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Nada fue un error</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">Sin procesar</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"main\">\n          <div class=\"detail-row\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n            <div>\n              <h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 28px;\">Contigo en la distancia</h1>\n              <div class=\"muted\">Vista 12 segundos - notas ampliadas</div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n              <div style=\"font-size: 30px; font-weight: 750;\">E4</div>\n              <div class=\"muted\">Nota detectada</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"graph\">\n            <div class=\"note-axis\">\n              <span>A4</span><span>G#4</span><span>G4</span><span>F#4</span><span>F4</span><span>E4</span><span>D#4</span><span>D4</span>\n            </div>\n            <svg class=\"pitch-ref\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 420\" aria-label=\"Pitch esperado\">\n              <path d=\"M55 292 L94 292 L120 220 L156 220 L188 248 L226 248 L262 170 L306 170 L345 194 L386 194 L430 128 L475 128 L518 160 L560 160 L604 98 L650 98 L696 140 L742 140 L790 204 L836 204\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"pitch-user\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 420\" aria-label=\"Pitch usuario\">\n              <path d=\"M55 305 L98 298 L122 232 L158 224 L192 260 L228 252 L263 178 L308 182 L348 210 L389 202 L434 146 L474 139 L520 168\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"cursor\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"timeline\">\n            <span>0:38</span>\n            <div class=\"track\"><span></span></div>\n            <span>3:12</span>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-145", "rollout_ordinal": 979, "created_at_ms": 1787157287534, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 979, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-145", "text": "Tercera propuesta: una interfaz más analítica para defender resultados, revisar intentos y diagnosticar filtros.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "call_0RGn91wqkYHz4x7KoYiKUkro", "rollout_ordinal": 982, "created_at_ms": 1787157320491, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 982, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_0RGn91wqkYHz4x7KoYiKUkro", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\mockups\\lab.html", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Karaoke Lab Mockup</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"mockups.css\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      background: #edf0ee;\n    }\n\n    .shell {\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .layout {\n      grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    }\n\n    .main {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .tabs {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 4px;\n      padding: 4px;\n      background: #eef1f4;\n      border: 1px solid var(--line);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .tab {\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .tab.active {\n      color: var(--ink);\n      background: #ffffff;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(20, 27, 38, 0.12);\n    }\n\n    .analysis-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 270px;\n      gap: 14px;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    .graph {\n      min-height: 390px;\n    }\n\n    .side-panel {\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-content: start;\n    }\n\n    .attempt {\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--line);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    .attempt strong {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .mini-bars {\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .mini-bars .track {\n      height: 7px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 980px) {\n      .analysis-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"shell\">\n      <header class=\"topbar\">\n        <div class=\"brand\">\n          <div class=\"mark\">KL</div>\n          <div>\n            <div>Karaoke Lab</div>\n            <div class=\"muted\">Medicion, diagnostico y evidencia</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"toolbar\">\n          <button class=\"button\">Exportar</button>\n          <button class=\"button primary\">Nuevo intento</button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"layout\">\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">Canciones</h2>\n          <div class=\"song-list\">\n            <div class=\"song-row active\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Contigo en la distancia</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">3 intentos</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">La incondicional</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">1 intento</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"song-row\">\n              <div class=\"song-main\">\n                <div class=\"song-title\">Nada fue un error</div>\n                <div class=\"song-artist\">0 intentos</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"main\">\n          <div class=\"tabs\">\n            <div class=\"tab active\">Desempeno</div>\n            <div class=\"tab\">Detalle</div>\n            <div class=\"tab\">Filtros</div>\n            <div class=\"tab\">Historial</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"analysis-grid\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"graph\">\n                <div class=\"note-axis\">\n                  <span>A4</span><span>G4</span><span>F4</span><span>E4</span><span>D4</span><span>C4</span><span>B3</span>\n                </div>\n                <svg class=\"pitch-ref\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 390\" aria-label=\"Pitch esperado\">\n                  <path d=\"M60 270 L95 270 L118 220 L158 220 L188 245 L225 245 L260 175 L304 175 L342 198 L385 198 L430 135 L470 135 L518 164 L560 164 L604 112 L650 112 L696 143 L744 143 L790 210 L836 210\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <svg class=\"pitch-user\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 390\" aria-label=\"Pitch usuario\">\n                  <path d=\"M60 282 L100 276 L122 229 L161 225 L190 255 L228 250 L262 184 L306 181 L348 212 L388 206 L433 148 L472 142 L518 175 L558 168\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <div class=\"scrollbar-x\"><span></span></div>\n                <div class=\"scrollbar-y\"><span></span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <aside class=\"side-panel\">\n              <div class=\"metric\">\n                <div class=\"metric-label\">Error promedio</div>\n                <div class=\"metric-value\">42c</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"metric\">\n                <div class=\"metric-label\">Afinado +/-50c</div>\n                <div class=\"metric-value\">71%</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"attempt\">\n                <strong>Diagnostico de filtros</strong>\n                <div class=\"muted\">Referencia: 78% conservado</div>\n                <div class=\"muted\">Usuario: 64% conservado</div>\n                <div class=\"mini-bars\">\n                  <div class=\"track\"><span style=\"width: 78%;\"></span></div>\n                  <div class=\"track\"><span style=\"width: 64%; background: var(--amber);\"></span></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"attempt\">\n                <strong>Ultimos intentos</strong>\n                <div class=\"muted\">12:21 - 42c - estable</div>\n                <div class=\"muted\">12:03 - 58c - agudo</div>\n                <div class=\"muted\">11:48 - 63c - grave</div>\n              </div>\n            </aside>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"toolbar\">\n            <button class=\"button primary\">Ver detalle</button>\n            <button class=\"button\">Ver desempeno completo</button>\n            <button class=\"button\">Comparar intentos</button>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "item-146", "rollout_ordinal": 985, "created_at_ms": 1787157322760, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 985, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-146", "text": "Creo también una página índice para abrir las tres opciones desde un solo lugar y compararlas rápido.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01add-b651-7283-b86c-d1cbfaba7704", "item_id": "call_HxfHNkqaiwrQChke8gCgB6rF", "rollout_ordinal": 988, "created_at_ms": 1787157352125, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 988, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_HxfHNkqaiwrQChke8gCgB6rF", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\mockups\\index.html", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Mockups Karaoke</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"mockups.css\">\n  <style>\n    .index-layout {\n      max-width: 1180px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      margin-bottom: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: 34px;\n    }\n\n    .preview-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .preview {\n      overflow: hidden;\n      color: inherit;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--line);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(20, 27, 38, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .preview-shot {\n      min-height: 180px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 17px, rgba(39, 47, 64, 0.1) 18px),\n        #f7f9fc;\n    }\n\n    .preview.live .preview-shot {\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 17px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) 18px),\n        #15171b;\n    }\n\n    .preview-title {\n      padding: 14px 14px 4px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n\n    .preview-copy {\n      padding: 0 14px 16px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n    }\n\n    .mini-window {\n      height: 150px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(120, 132, 152, 0.28);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n    }\n\n    .preview.live .mini-window {\n      background: #202328;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n    }\n\n    .mini-window svg {\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .mini-window path {\n      fill: none;\n      stroke-width: 5;\n      stroke-linecap: round;\n      stroke-linejoin: round;\n    }\n\n    .mini-ref {\n      stroke: var(--blue);\n    }\n\n    .mini-user {\n      stroke: var(--red);\n    }\n\n    .preview.live .mini-ref {\n      stroke: #61a5ff;\n    }\n\n    .preview.live .mini-user {\n      stroke: #ff756b;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 920px) {\n      .preview-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"index-layout\">\n      <section class=\"hero\">\n        <h1>Pruebas visuales para Karaoke Afinacion</h1>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Tres direcciones de interfaz para decidir el proximo framework visual.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"preview-grid\">\n        <a class=\"preview\" href=\"studio.html\">\n          <div class=\"preview-shot\">\n            <div class=\"mini-window\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 150\" aria-label=\"Vista studio\">\n                <path class=\"mini-ref\" d=\"M18 110 L48 110 L62 82 L92 82 L112 96 L144 96 L168 62 L202 62 L232 78 L260 78 L290 48 L336 48\"></path>\n                <path class=\"mini-user\" d=\"M18 116 L48 112 L64 88 L94 84 L116 102 L146 97 L170 70 L204 66 L232 84 L260 82\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preview-title\">Studio</div>\n          <div class=\"preview-copy\">Sobrio, profesional, cercano a una app de escritorio moderna.</div>\n        </a>\n\n        <a class=\"preview live\" href=\"live.html\">\n          <div class=\"preview-shot\">\n            <div class=\"mini-window\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 150\" aria-label=\"Vista live\">\n                <path class=\"mini-ref\" d=\"M18 112 L48 112 L64 76 L92 76 L112 92 L146 92 L170 55 L202 55 L232 72 L260 72 L290 36 L336 36\"></path>\n                <path class=\"mini-user\" d=\"M18 120 L50 114 L66 84 L94 78 L118 99 L148 94 L172 63 L204 59 L234 80 L262 74\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preview-title\">Live</div>\n          <div class=\"preview-copy\">Mas inmersivo, pensado para cantar y mirar la guia sin distraccion.</div>\n        </a>\n\n        <a class=\"preview\" href=\"lab.html\">\n          <div class=\"preview-shot\">\n            <div class=\"mini-window\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 150\" aria-label=\"Vista lab\">\n                <path class=\"mini-ref\" d=\"M18 108 L48 108 L64 84 L92 84 L112 94 L146 94 L170 64 L202 64 L232 77 L260 77 L290 52 L336 52\"></path>\n                <path class=\"mini-user\" d=\"M18 116 L50 112 L66 90 L94 88 L118 101 L148 96 L172 72 L204 68 L234 84 L262 82\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"preview-title\">Lab</div>\n          <div class=\"preview-copy\">Mas tecnico, util para tesis, metricas, diagnostico e historial.</div>\n        </a>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
